%section.marketing-hero
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Continuous clarity for growing teams
    %h1.mb-3 Continuous clarity. Unfading growth.
    %p.lead.mb-4
      Fairness you can see, coaching with specifics, and talent density that sells upward ... without the busy work.

    .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2
      = link_to "Start Free", start_free_path, class: "btn btn-dark btn-lg px-4"
      = link_to "See Solutions", solutions_path, class: "btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg"
      = link_to "Pricing", pricing_path, class: "btn btn-link btn-lg text-decoration-none"
    %p.small.text-muted.mt-3.mb-0
      Built for teams that care about fairness and continuous growth (becomes increasingly more important when your company has between 10 and 50 managers). Upload a job description and see clarity take shape ...
      = succeed "." do
        = link_to "free, forever", start_free_path
